  "description": "5 DAY DANGEROUS TREE NOTICE\r\nWillow in Front Drive - To be reduced to original pollard points approx 3.5m leaving height 11m and width 8m - Tree is dangerous  \r\nThe weight of the tree is plainly drawing it down to the ground and it must be at risk of catastrophic collapse causing injury or damage.  \r\nA very old scar on the tree is now in our reach when it was not even 6 or 9 months ago.\r\nWe are asking for this to be done urgently as we are concerned that there is a real risk of injury or damage.",
